apps/kray-net/data-*/
data-signet-local/

# operator-local (SSH pubkeys, host maps) — never the public tree
ops/
logs/

# Operator handoff / ship ritual — keep on this disk, never the public door
docs/HANDOFF-*.md
docs/OPERATOR-SHIP.md
docs/KRAYOS-MIND.md
docs/kept/

# Writer-disk deploy kit — lives on this backup + workshop, never the public door
